License index for the xfold-optimized repository
==============================================

This file is an index, not a new blanket permission grant or a relicensing of
the bundled source.

The original component license texts and third-party notices are preserved:

  af3_torch/LICENSE
  af3_torch/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
  af3_torch/third_party_licenses/
  common/opt_core/LICENSE
  common/opt_core/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
  common/opt_core/third_party_licenses/

Additional third-party LICENSE and NOTICE files reside beside their components.
Retain these files and all per-file copyright/license headers on redistribution.
Consult the applicable component text for each portion of the repository.

Important inherited licensing caveat:
The af3_torch third-party notices record that xfold's repository-level license
is Apache-2.0 while some carried AlphaFold-derived files retain CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
headers. The pinned source preserves that mismatch and links the upstream issue.
This packaging does not resolve that inconsistency or establish legal
compatibility for a particular intended use.

Model weights and external featurizer binaries are not included. Their own
terms apply when obtained separately.

See NOTICE.md for provenance and attribution of the accepted modifications.
